                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.2515/3318: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Moore</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-03-27T17:00:00-05:00">March 27, 1929—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>51. The Peruvian engineers arrived here from Arica by aeroplane this afternoon at
                    4:30.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
